{"message":"The reserve for product warranties was $10 million at Dec. 31, 2006 and $4 million at Dec. 31, 2005 (post_text q11). The change from 2005 to 2006 is the 2006 reserve minus the 2005 reserve, in millions: 10 - 4.","tool":"calculate","arguments":{"expression":"r2006 - r2005","variables":{"r2006":{"value":10,"source":"source:q11n3","unit":"million"},"r2005":{"value":4,"source":"source:q11n4","unit":"million"}},"sources":{"r2006":"source:q11n3","r2005":"source:q11n4"}}}